{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":40.65999984741211,"text":"Every city that asked the oracle and got the answer it wanted sent a gift and because the gifts were competitive Each one tried to be more expensive, larger, or cleverer than the last So the sacred way, the road climbing up to the temple, filled with statues and small marble buildings packed with treasure What survived is now in this museum a few meters downhill. It is not large and that is an advantage You can see all of it and still remember what you saw There is a young man in bronze still holding his reins, two brothers in marble, a Sphinx that once sat on a 10 meter column, and a stone that people called the center of the world","words":[{"word":"Every","start":0,"end":0.6000000238418579},{"word":"city","start":0.6000000238418579,"end":0.9599999785423279},{"word":"that","start":0.9599999785423279,"end":1.159999966621399},{"word":"asked","start":1.159999966621399,"end":1.5},{"word":"the","start":1.5,"end":1.7200000286102295},{"word":"oracle","start":1.7200000286102295,"end":2.0199999809265137},{"word":"and","start":2.0199999809265137,"end":2.380000114440918},{"word":"got","start":2.380000114440918,"end":2.5799999237060547},{"word":"the","start":2.5799999237060547,"end":3},{"word":"answer","start":3,"end":3},{"word":"it","start":3,"end":3.740000009536743},{"word":"wanted","start":3.740000009536743,"end":3.740000009536743},{"word":"sent","start":3.740000009536743,"end":4.019999980926514},{"word":"a","start":4.019999980926514,"end":4.480000019073486},{"word":"gift","start":4.480000019073486,"end":4.480000019073486},{"word":"and","start":4.480000019073486,"end":5.139999866485596},{"word":"because","start":5.139999866485596,"end":5.460000038146973},{"word":"the","start":5.460000038146973,"end":5.880000114440918},{"word":"gifts","start":5.880000114440918,"end":5.880000114440918},{"word":"were","start":5.880000114440918,"end":6.159999847412109},{"word":"competitive","start":6.159999847412109